extends /specs/products/app/page-structure/structure/templates/structure/layout-tmpl.jade

block content

    section.source_section
        h2 Buttons variations

        h3 Default with hover and focus effects button
        markdown
            p In the example below we have added `btn` to the button item.
        .source_example
            button.btn I am button

        h3 Disabled button
        markdown
            p In the example below we have added `disabled` attribute to make the button disabled.
        .source_example
            button.btn(disabled="disabled") I am button

        h3 Full-width button
        markdown
            p In the example below we have added `btn` and `btn--full-width` to the button item to be fluid width.
        .source_example
            button.btn.btn--full-width I am full-width button

        h3 Submit button
        markdown
            p In the example below we have added `btn--inverse` to the button item.
        .source_example
            button.btn--inverse I am button

        h3 Cancel button
        markdown
            p In the example below we have added `btn--cancel` class to the button item.
        .source_example
            button.btn--cancel I am button

        h3  Button themes
        markdown
            p In the example below we have added the theming class like `ajp-theme` , `apa-journal` to the button container.
        .source_example
            div.ajp-theme
                button.btn I am button
            div.apa-journal
                button.btn I am button
            div.dsm-theme
                button.btn I am button
            div.pl-theme
                button.btn I am button
            div.ebooks-theme
                button.btn I am button
        h3  Button inverse themes
        markdown
            p In the example below we have added the themming class like :`ajp-theme` , `apa-journal`  to the button container.
        .source_example
            div.ajp-theme
                button.btn--inverse I am button
            div.apa-journal
                button.btn--inverse I am button
            div.dsm-theme
                button.btn--inverse I am button
            div.pl-theme
                button.btn--inverse I am button
            div.ebooks-theme
                button.btn--inverse I am button

        h3  Link color
        markdown
            p In the example below we have added link class `link`
        .source_example
            a.link This is Link

        h3  Meta Journal Button
        markdown
            p In the example below we have added link class `btn btn--inverse btn--journal-meta`
        .source_example
            a.btn.btn--inverse.btn--journal-meta Button


    | #{''}